  "notes": "Angels: no motif, no figure. Their demand (8:1-5) is glossed only as «تعنتا مبنيا على الجهل». No motif on the Prophet ﷺ. Footsteps for «سيروا في الأرض». STAGING v4: 8-9: three deniers in a town at dusk speak their demand on 8:1 (framed by the gloss); no angel, no plate on an angel word, no lone man; the counterfactual 8:6-9:9 carries no gesture, only the camera and a seal plate on 8:9 (the matter decided). 10: former mockers (messengers not drawn) speak on 10:1, turn on 10:2 and leave on 10:3, before 10:6; darkness then falls on the empty town (no one hurt, no ruin). 11: the empty town with a footsteps plate on 11:2; no travellers are drawn (a command addressed to the deniers)."
